WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.513
On the write side, each policy is one
file in Git, and the file has two halves.

2
00:00:05.513 --> 00:00:09.072
The policy half is exactly
the body Graph will receive,

3
00:00:09.072 --> 00:00:13.026
in the shape Learn documents, so
what's reviewed is what's sent.

4
00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:17.981
The other half is the record: who approves
a change, which tool owns these settings,

5
00:00:17.981 --> 00:00:22.937
which old policies they came from, and a
decision record for every single setting.

6
00:00:22.937 --> 00:00:27.588
The setting identifiers in the two sample
files come from Learn's own examples,

7
00:00:27.588 --> 00:00:30.450
and the chapter's advice
is to export one from the

8
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.580
admin center and compare
before trusting any other.
